      deck: '36-card pack (Swiss-German bells, shields, acorns, roses; or French hearts, diamonds, spades, clubs).',
      equipment: 'Cards.',
      dealing: 'First dealer random. Dealer shuffles, left player cuts. Deal all 36 cards anticlockwise in batches of 3, so each player receives 9 cards. Deal rotates right after each hand.',
